# Text files are LF in every checkout, Windows' too (S29, M55): the Ghostty
# patches, test fixtures and scripts expect it, and Git for Windows (and
# GitHub's Windows runners) default to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Patches apply to LF sources, whatever the checkout does on Windows (S29).
vendor/libghostty-vt-sys/patches/*.patch -text
